<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CMP Media started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CMP Media started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Tuesday it started coverage of CMP Media Inc, adding it to the firm's recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was unchanged at 26-1/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
